OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATooting Bec keen to extend
OL,4,Afairy-tale FA Cup run
OL,5,
OL,6,FTooting Bec Women are plotting another
OL,7,FFA Cup upset having caused one of the
OL,8,Fshocks of the third qualifying round to
OL,9,Freach the competition proper for the
OL,10,Ffirst time.
OL,12,FThe tier-six side came from behind to
OL,13,Fbeat tier-five Oxford City 2-1 last
OL,14,FSunday and will now face tier-four
OL,15,Foutfit Chatham Town in the first round
OL,16,Fat the end of October.
OL,18,FNot only does the win over Oxford
OL,19,Frepresent one of the greatest results
OL,20,Fin The Bec's history but it also
OL,21,Fsecured them much-needed funds through
OL,22,Fthe Women's FA Cup prize purse.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
